  "question": {
    "text": "If the length of the perpendicular from the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> to the line, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is <math><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math> , then <math><mi>&#946;</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
