  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0276_33cf01662da8.png\" style=\"width: 506px; height: 277px;\" /></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Direction ratio&#39;s of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> is perpendicular to given line, hence</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
